,"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058:m0690","quote":"表"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-055","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-appraisal","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-055-appraisal","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-appraisal:line141","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-appraisal:line141:m0046","quote":"陳表"}],"identity_note":"卷五十五陳武庶子；卷五十二稱新都都尉，與顧承會佃毗陵。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-055","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058:m0092"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058:m0092","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058:m0092"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-wu055-chenbiao-2","subject_person_id":"djn_r5z_2w9","object_person_id":"b08_b01_kow","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"表母不肯事脩母"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-055","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058","quote":"弟表，字文奧，武庶子也，少知名，與諸葛恪、顧譚、張休等並侍東宮，皆共親友。尚書曁豔亦與表善，後豔遇罪，時人咸自營護，信厚言薄，表獨不然，士以此重之。徙太子中庶子，拜翼正都尉。兄脩亡後，表母不肯事脩母，表謂其母曰：「兄不幸早亡，表統家事，當奉嫡母。母若能爲表屈情，承順嫡母者，是至願也；若母不能，直當出別居耳。」表於大義公正如此。由是二母感寤雍穆。表以父死敵場，求用爲將，領兵五百人。表欲得戰士之力，傾意接待，士皆愛附，樂爲用命。時有盜官物者，疑無難士施明。明素壯悍，收考極毒，惟死無辭，廷尉以聞。權以表能得健兒之心，詔以明付表，使自以意求其情實。表便破械沐浴，易其衣服，厚設酒食，歡以誘之。明乃首服，具列支黨。表以狀聞。權奇之，欲全其名，特爲赦明，誅戮其黨。遷表爲無難右部督，封都亭侯，以繼舊爵。表皆陳讓，乞以傳脩子延，權不許。嘉禾三年，諸葛恪領丹楊太守，討平山越，以表領新安都尉，與恪參勢。初，表所受賜復人得二百家，在會稽新安縣。表簡視其人，皆堪好兵，乃上疏陳讓，乞以還官，充足精銳。詔曰：「先將軍有功於國，國家以此報之，卿何得辭焉？」表乃稱曰：「今除國賊，報父之仇，以人爲本。空枉此勁銳以爲僮僕，非表志也。」皆輒料取以充部伍。所在以聞，權甚嘉之。下郡縣，料正戶羸民以補其處。表在官三年，廣開降納，得兵萬餘人。事捷當出，會鄱陽民吳遽等爲亂，攻沒城郭，屬縣搖動，表便越界赴討，遽以破敗，遂降。陸遜拜表偏將軍，進封都鄉侯，北屯章阬。年三十四卒。家財盡於養士，死之日，妻子露立，太子登爲起屋宅。子敖年十七，拜別部司馬，授兵四百人。敖卒，脩子延復爲司馬代敖。延弟永，將軍，封侯。始施明感表，自變行爲善，遂成健將，致位將軍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058:m0001","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058:m0092"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058:m0092","surface":"表母","start":92,"end":94,"kind":"person","person_id":"b08_b01_kow","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-wu055-chenbiao-2","subject_person_id":"djn_r5z_2w9","object_person_id":"b08_b01_kow","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"表母不肯事脩母"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-055","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chenbiao:line058","quote":"弟表，字文奧，武庶子也，少知名，與諸葛恪、顧譚、張休等並侍東宮，皆共親友。尚書曁豔亦與表善，後豔遇罪，時人咸自營護，信厚言薄，表獨不然，士以此重之。徙太子中庶子，拜翼正都尉。兄脩亡後，表母不肯事脩母，表謂其母曰：「兄不幸早亡，表統家